SUMMARY:Reading Area Loop Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this super happy loop hike through all sorts of diversified su
 rroundings in the Reading PA area!\nWe'll start out by walking trails from
  our start in Wyomissing Park out to the Schuylkill River Trail. Once we g
 et there\, we'll make our way eastbound on the trail.\nMost of the beginni
 ng will be tracing the former Pennsylvania Railroad east.\nWe'll pass some
  historic sites and cross two large bridges\, and then if timing works out
 \, we'll stop by Ridgewood Winery.\nAnother side trip will take us to Alle
 gheny Aqueduct Park on the Schuylkill Navigation.\nWe'll cross the Schuylk
 ill and then we'll pick up the Exeter River Trail west.\nWe'll continue on
  this to Neversink Mountain\, cover some of the trails there\, and come ba
 ck into Reading with some more riverfront trail and historic sites before 
 reaching Schuylkill River Trail again. We'll return to Wyomissing and back
  to our meeting point to close about 16 miles.\nIf needed\, contact me at 
 908 343 8374
